      "excerpt": "I have tried to contact Harman Technology, https://www.harmantechnology.com/which produces photographic products, with the hope of attracting them to come to ISDH 2026, with no success. They had produced Holo FX holographic plates around 2012, and I received samples for evaluation, and they were much better than Slavich PFG-01 and VRP-M, and even the old Agfa Holotest line up, the proof being I could get great single beam reflection holograms on the Holo FX green emulsion which was impossible…",
