      "excerpt": "Finally, I have to compile formula for preparation of ultra fine grain silver halide emulsion for color holography, based on Silver Cross project. Any comments, experiments and improvements are greatly welcomed and will be implemented in future revisions of the attached document. Despite of really good results, there is still room for improvement in sensitization, alternative ways of developement procedure and plate preparation. Have a fun... with stable fringes! And happy new year!",
